# DRIVEMITRA – COMPLETE UNIFIED MOBILE APPLICATION IMPLEMENTATION

## 1. Project Objective

Build a complete, production-ready **DriveMitra mobile application** using React Native, Expo and JavaScript.

IMPORTANT: This is NOT a driver-only application.

DriveMitra is a unified fleet management mobile application designed for:

1. Fleet Owners
2. Fleet Staff
3. Fleet Drivers

All three user types must use the SAME mobile application.

The application must automatically identify the authenticated user's role and display the appropriate dashboard, navigation, modules, actions and permissions.

Do not create three separate applications.

Do not create a driver application and simply add an owner dashboard to it.

Build a complete mobile fleet management platform with role-based experiences.

The mobile application must connect to the existing DriveMitra backend and database. It must preserve the existing web application's functionality and business logic.

