### Background GPS

Use Expo Location and Expo TaskManager where appropriate.

Requirements:

- Request location permission transparently.
- Explain why background tracking is required.
- Track only for authorised operational purposes.
- Respect OS permission and battery restrictions.
- Store location timestamps.
- Queue offline location records.
- Synchronise when connectivity returns.
- Avoid excessive battery consumption.
- Provide clear tracking status.

IMPORTANT:

Do not promise uninterrupted tracking if the operating system terminates the app, the user revokes permission, device battery runs out or device restrictions prevent background execution.

Test background location using a development build and physical devices.

Phone GPS is not equivalent to actual vehicle telematics.

Do not claim phone GPS can measure fuel tank level, engine temperature, RPM, tyre pressure, battery health or diagnostic fault codes.

These require compatible hardware, sensors or integrations.

